      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the names of all classes declared as members of the class represented by\nthis ClassMetadata object.",
      "translation": "返回此 ClassMetadata 对象所表示的类中声明的所有成员类的名称。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Determine whether the underlying class is independent, i.e.",
      "translation": "确定底层类是否独立，即",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Determine whether the underlying class is independent, i.e. whether it is\na top-level class or a static nested class that can be constructed\nindependently of an enclosing class.",
      "translation": "确定底层类是否独立，即它是否为顶层类或可独立于外部类构造的静态嵌套类。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the names of all classes declared as members of the class represented by\nthis ClassMetadata object. This includes public, protected, default (package)\naccess, and private classes and interfaces declared by the class, but excludes\ninherited classes and interfaces. An empty array is returned if no member classes\nor interfaces exist.",
      "translation": "返回此 `ClassMetadata` 对象所表示的类中声明的所有类的名称。这包括该类声明的具有 public、protected、默认（包）访问权限和 private 访问权限的类和接口，但不包括继承的类和接口。如果不存在成员类或接口，则返回一个空数组。",
      "count": 1
    },
